  "remarks": "Abubakar Swalleh provides financial, material, or technological support for, or financial or other services to, or in support of, ISIL (listed as Al-Qaida in Iraq (QDe.115). He acted, since 2018, as an ISIL facilitator who provides financial and logistic support including recruitment for ISIL in East and Southern Africa. Phone number:  +963936016952. Gender: Male. Photo available for inclusion in the INTERPOL-UN Security Council  Special Notice INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice: https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we\nwork/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Individuals#2025-47413 ",
